<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Dec 18.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Dec 18.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some Australian stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>*Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd A$16.94 (-.37)</p>
<p>Resources giant shares still likely to feel the effect of Tuesday's agreement with Japanese steelmakers over coal prices and shipments and the market is also to digest BHP's half year productions figures released after yesterday's market close.</p>
<p>Share prices of other Australian coal producers are also likely to be effected following the BHP agreement, including;</p>
<p>QCT Resources Ltd A$1.60 (-.03)</p>
<p>Coal and Allied Ltd A$11.00 (-.50)</p>
<p>*Highlands Gold Ltd A$.75 (-.01)</p>
<p>Papua New Guinean miner drops threat of legal action against bidder Placer Dome Inc, but still rejects offer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
